# EY IT Services Intelligence Console
# Environment configuration
#
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# THE CONSOLE RUNS WITH THIS FILE COMPLETELY EMPTY.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Every data source it uses is public and keyless: company filings from the
# investor relations site, Yahoo Finance for quotes, Frankfurter and
# open.er-api for exchange rates, Google News and Yahoo Finance RSS for news.
# The chat assistant answers from a built-in retrieval engine that runs
# in-process and needs no key either.
#
# Everything below is optional. To use it, copy this file to .env.local and
# fill in ONE of the provider blocks. Do not commit .env.local.
#
#   cp .env.example .env.local
#
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional: upgrade the chat assistant from extractive to generative
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Without a key, the assistant answers by selecting and composing the passages
# that match the question, and cites each one. That is accurate but reads like
# assembled evidence rather than prose.
#
# With a key, the same retrieved passages are handed to a language model that
# writes the answer. Retrieval, citation and the injection defences are
# identical either way; only the phrasing changes. The model is instructed to
# use nothing outside the retrieved passages.
#
# Set exactly one block. They are checked in the order listed here.

# --- Local model, no account and no key required -------------------
# Install Ollama from ollama.com, then: ollama pull llama3.1:8b
# This keeps every question on your own machine.
# OLLAMA_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434
# OLLAMA_MODEL=llama3.1:8b

# --- NVIDIA NIM, free tier, no credit card -------------------------
# Sign up at build.nvidia.com and create an API key.
# NVIDIA_API_KEY=
# NVIDIA_MODEL=meta/llama-3.3-70b-instruct

# --- Groq, free tier, no credit card -------------------------------
# Sign up at console.groq.com.
# GROQ_API_KEY=
# GROQ_MODEL=llama-3.3-70b-versatile

# --- Hugging Face Inference Providers, free tier --------------------
# Sign up at huggingface.co and create a token with inference permission.
# HUGGINGFACE_API_KEY=
# HUGGINGFACE_MODEL=meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct

# --- OpenRouter, free tier -----------------------------------------
# Sign up at openrouter.ai.
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
# OPENROUTER_MODEL=meta-llama/llama-3.3-70b-instruct:free
